      "output": {
        "decision": "answer",
        "reason": "The evidence directly answers how BERT is optimized: according to the Abstract and Related Work sections, BERT is adopted as the feature extraction layer at the bottom of the multi-head selection framework (replacing BiLSTM), and it is further optimized by introducing a semantic-enhanced task during BERT pre-training. The Conclusion reiterates 'Enhanced BERT pre-training' as a key technology. This fully supports the question."
